              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 40:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyabazinga Nebukadinezzari ow'e Babilonia yaataagho Gedalia, mutabane wa Ahikamu era mwidhukulu wa Shafani, abe omufuzi w'abantu abaasigala mu Buyudaaya, kyabazinga oyo be yalekamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaaligho abakulu mu magye ga Buyudaaya n'abaisirukale baibwe abaali mu irungu, nga bakaali kweghaayo. Bwe baawulira nga kyabazinga w'e Babilonia aghaire Gedalia obufuzi, baidha eri Gedalia oyo e Mizipa. Abaidha baali bano: Ishimaeli mutabane wa Nethania, ni Yohanani mutabane wa Karea, ni Seraia mutabane wa Tanhumethi ow'e Netofa, ni Yaazania mutabane w'omusaadha ow'e Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia yaabalayirira, ng'akoba ati: “Mutatya bakungu Abababilonia. Imwe musigale mu nsi eno mugheereze bugheereze kyabazinga w'e Babilonia, byonabyona biidha kubajiira bukalamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
